.Dd 2025-09-30
.Dt BN_SWAP 3ossl
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm BN_swap
.Nd exchange BIGNUMs
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.In openssl/bn.h
.Ft void
.Fo BN_swap
.Fa "BIGNUM *a"
.Fa "BIGNUM *b"
.Fc
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Fn BN_swap
exchanges the values of
.Fa a
and
.Fa b .
.Sh RETURN VALUES
.Fn BN_swap
does not return a value.
